{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791236267,"nonce":"tt03OuOiAs25U2JCEA4o+Morq1A=","title":"AIR v2 sroa::classify spends 11 s lowering one function with a large literal","message":"ashui's `ashui.components.Library.use()` builds its stylesheet from literals emitted at compile time (CompiledCss macro, ashui 191252c): 517 rules of anonymous structures, arrays and `new Selector(...)` calls, all in one function. The first call takes about 11 s on both `--mode interp` and `--mode hybrid`. Every app that uses ashui's components waits that long before its first frame, with the window blank and white.\n\n**Reproducer** (ashui checkout beside ash, hlwgpu, hlwindow):\n\n```\nclass Repro {\n\tstatic function main() {\n\t\tvar t = haxe.Timer.stamp();\n\t\tashui.components.Library.use();\n\t\tSys.println('Library.use: ${Math.round((haxe.Timer.stamp() - t) * 1000)} ms');\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n```\nvib=~/Vibranium\nhaxe --class-path $vib/ashui/haxe --class-path $vib/ashui/components/haxe \\\n  --class-path $vib/hlwgpu/haxe --class-path $vib/hlwindow/haxe -lib tink_hxx -lib hashlink \\\n  -D ashui_window --macro 'ashui.core.render.UiFramework.register()' --macro 'ashui.ui.Markup.enable()' \\\n  -w -WDeprecated --class-path . -main Repro -hl Repro.hl\nash --mode interp Repro.hl     # Library.use: 10931 ms\nash --mode hybrid Repro.hl     # Library.use: 10927 ms\n```\n\nA copy is in /tmp/claude-501/repro (Repro.hx, Repro.hl).\n\n**Profile** (ASH_PROFILE=sample, dumped with SIGUSR1 just before the first frame): 98% of samples are native, under one interpreted function:\n\n```\n34.2%  air::v2::passes::sroa::classify\n18.7%  air::v2::passes::replace_all_uses\n11.2%  RandomState::hash_one\n 8.0%  RawTable\u003c(ValueId, Vec\u003cValueId\u003e)\u003e::reserve_rehash\n 5.3%  Instr::uses\n 4.1%  SipHasher::write\n```\n\nThe same sheet built from main() takes 7 ms, so cost depends on the function it lands in, not on what the literal does at run time. Splitting the literal into immediately-called local closures of 16 rules each did not change the time.\n\nAsh HEAD at time of filing: see `git log -1` on the day of filing (2026-10-05).","files":null}]}